#!/bin/bash
# Advanced Dirt Removal: install the macros from the staging folder (the OFX
# bundle is already in /Library/OFX/Plugins), or undo everything when the user
# chose "Uninstall Only".
# $3 = target volume (e.g. /)

set -euo pipefail

VOLUME="${3:-/}"
VOLUME="${VOLUME%/}"

MACROS_PATH="${VOLUME}/Library/Application Support/Blackmagic Design/DaVinci Resolve/Fusion/Macros"
MACRO_1="Advanced Dirt Removal.setting"
MACRO_2="Advanced Dirt Removal Cineon.setting"
BUNDLE="${VOLUME}/Library/OFX/Plugins/AdvancedDirtRemoval.ofx.bundle"
STAGING="${VOLUME}/tmp/AdvancedDirtRemoval_payload"
PKG_IDENTIFIER="com.fabiocolor.AdvancedDirtRemoval"
ACTION_FILE="${VOLUME}/tmp/AdvancedDirtRemoval_action"

ACTION="install"
if [ -f "$ACTION_FILE" ]; then
  ACTION="$(cat "$ACTION_FILE")"
  rm -f "$ACTION_FILE"
fi

if [ "$ACTION" = "uninstall" ]; then
  rm -f "${MACROS_PATH}/${MACRO_1}" "${MACROS_PATH}/${MACRO_2}"
  rm -rf "$BUNDLE"
  pkgutil --volume "${VOLUME:-/}" --forget "$PKG_IDENTIFIER" >/dev/null 2>&1 || true
  echo "Advanced Dirt Removal uninstalled."
else
  mkdir -p "$MACROS_PATH"
  cp "${STAGING}/${MACRO_1}" "${STAGING}/${MACRO_2}" "$MACROS_PATH/"
  echo "Advanced Dirt Removal installed."
fi
rm -rf "$STAGING"
